{%- comment -%}
  Partner/feature PDP: free-shipping note, Create a Box, then an "or" rule, above the size
  switcher and buy box (same pattern as the standard PDP in templates/product.liquid).
  No variant is passed, so the box drawer asks for the texture. box-builder.css hides
  .fc-box-lead when the product is not in a box collection (no visible button).

  Params:
    product   the coffee
{%- endcomment -%}
<div class="fc-box-lead fc-box-lead--dark">
  <p class="fcbox__message shadow">All subscriptions are eligible for <b>FREE SHIPPING!</b></p>
  {%- render 'box-button', product: product, class: 'fc-box-btn--dark fc-box-btn--solid' -%}
  <p class="fc-box-or">or</p>
</div>
<style>
  .fc-box-lead--dark { margin: 30px 0 0; max-width: 468px; }
  .fc-box-lead--dark .fcbox__message { color: #fff; }
  .fc-box-lead--dark .fc-box-btn { max-width: none; }
  .fc-box-lead--dark .fc-box-or { color: #fff; }
  @media (max-width: 767px) { .fc-box-lead--dark { max-width: none; } }
</style>
